=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: the test job loses `when: manual` and runs on every pipeline again
origin: issue #214 acceptance — a strengthened job is no weakened command.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
  when: manual
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
